      ],
      "What Makes This Specialization Unique?": "What makes this specialization unique is its focus on understanding people's emotions and experiences, rather than just numbers and data. Unlike other research roles that might focus on statistics, Qualitative UX Research is all about the stories and feelings behind user interactions. It's like being a storyteller who helps design better products by understanding what users truly need and want.",
